rder-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">1:         0 checkpoint      init             5</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(234,234,234);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">2:         0       save      init             5</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(234,234,234);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">3:         0   progress      init             5</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(234,234,234);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">4:         0       load      init             5</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(234,234,234);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">5:         0     ageMap      init             5</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(234,234,234);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(117,122,216)\">&gt; tmp=spades(mySim)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(222,142,48)\">Error in get(moduleCall, envir = sim@.envir[[cur[[&quot;moduleName&quot;]]]]) :</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(222,142,48)\">  invalid &#39;envir&#39; argument</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;padding:0in 0in 6pt 4.5pt\"></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;padding:0in 0in 6pt 4.5pt\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"width:840.75pt\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"1121\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:0.75pt;padding:0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(117,122,216)\">&gt;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"
