  {
   "id": "kC4iwjAxAgAJ",
   "from": "Eliot McIntire",
   "author": "98614b368d11c847",
   "date": "2018-02-06T21:30:35Z",
   "subject": "Re: Error in get(moduleCall, envir = sim@.envir[[cur[[\"moduleName\"]]]]) :    invalid 'envir' argument",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This happens when the user creates an object in the simList that is the same name as the module. And it may not be occurring in the module itself. <div><br></div><div>example:</div><div>Say there is a module called FireModule</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">mySim &lt;- simInit(...., modules = list(&quot;FireModule&quot;))</font></div><div><br></div><div>This will put all the functions from that module inside <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">sim$FireModule</font></div><div><br></div><div>Then if some module does this:</div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">sim$FireModule &lt;- TRUE</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">then you will get the above error. </font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The development version of SpaDES.core will shortly have a meaningful error indicating this is the problem. The user will have to fix this themselves by *never* making an object with the same name as a module.</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "HFXLpOv8BAAJ",
   "from": "Eliot McIntire",
   "author": "98614b368d11c847",
   "date": "2018-02-06T23:33:45Z",
   "subject": "Re: Error in get(moduleCall, envir = sim@.envir[[cur[[\"moduleName\"]]]]) :    invalid 'envir' argument",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This has now been superceded, by locking the sim$&lt;moduleName&gt; binding. In other words, it won&#39;t work if a module tries to assign something that that name.<div><br></div><div>This has been added in github commit: <a href=\"https://github.com/PredictiveEcology/SpaDES.core/commit/858a68015abff8d82e4c0c0306f13869b49fd76c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/PredictiveEcology/SpaDES.core/commit/858a68015abff8d82e4c0c0306f13869b49fd76c&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498010210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2y_TKm2YtEHDJoWG5izbDH\">https://github.com/PredictiveEcology/SpaDES.core/commit/858a68015abff8d82e4c0c0306f13869b49fd76c</a> </div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
